WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.691
- Every single human being has value

00:00:02.691 --> 00:00:05.177
and my value is not
determined on how I look

00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:06.606
or what job I have.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:08.081
You know, so many people
put me down and say

00:00:08.081 --> 00:00:09.169
Nick you look too weird

00:00:09.169 --> 00:00:10.069
and no one's really a friend and

00:00:10.069 --> 00:00:12.134
you can't do this and you can't do that.

00:00:12.134 --> 00:00:14.349
And for three months he
would chase after me and say

00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:16.063
Nick go speak, go speak, go speak

00:00:16.063 --> 00:00:17.469
and I said no, no, no, no,

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:19.936
and finally he twisted my arm, I said yes.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:21.329
You're going to take three
seconds I'm going to tell you

00:00:21.329 --> 00:00:23.810
something discouraging but then

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.353
you may never forget my words.

00:00:26.353 --> 00:00:28.545
- He's an Australian,
Christian, Evangelist,

00:00:28.545 --> 00:00:30.149
and motivational speaker.

00:00:30.149 --> 00:00:32.159
He was born with a rare
disorder which left him

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:34.076
without any arms or legs.

00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:35.963
He founded Attitude is Altitude,

00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:38.337
a secular motivational speaking company.

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.243
He's Nick Vujicic and here is my take

00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:42.128
on his top ten rules for success.

00:00:42.128 --> 00:00:43.673
Number two is my personal favorite

00:00:43.673 --> 00:00:45.458
and make sure to stick
around all the way to the end

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:47.264
for some special bonus clips.

00:00:47.264 --> 00:00:49.181
(beat)

00:00:50.673 --> 00:00:52.965
- Every single human being has value and

00:00:52.965 --> 00:00:56.832
my value is not determined on
how I look or what job I have,

00:00:56.832 --> 00:01:00.411
or where I'm from or where I was born,

00:01:00.411 --> 00:01:04.535
how much money, all that stuff is nothing.

00:01:04.535 --> 00:01:07.724
So many teenagers you know,
tease each other for how we look

00:01:07.724 --> 00:01:11.961
and I tell the teenagers "Do
you think that I'm cool enough

00:01:11.961 --> 00:01:14.657
to be your friend", they're
like "Yeah of course."

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:16.280
Said "But I have no arms, no legs."

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:18.235
They said "Doesn't matter."

00:01:18.235 --> 00:01:19.470
I said "Really so it
doesn't matter that I have

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.793
no arms, no legs?"

00:01:20.793 --> 00:01:22.288
They said "No it doesn't matter."

00:01:22.288 --> 00:01:24.835
I said "Then actually
if it doesn't matter,

00:01:24.835 --> 00:01:27.750
then why do we kill each
other with our words

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.197
if it actually doesn't matter?

00:01:30.197 --> 00:01:32.806
Why do we look ourselves in the mirror

00:01:32.806 --> 00:01:35.639
and see ugly instead of valuable?"

00:01:36.981 --> 00:01:40.915
Want to ask you today,
what are you looking for?

00:01:40.915 --> 00:01:44.125
If I gave you a billion
dollars, would you be happy?

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:46.486
If you gave me a billion
dollars, I'd be very happy.

00:01:46.486 --> 00:01:47.881
(laughter)

00:01:47.881 --> 00:01:52.213
But then if my mum dies
tonight am I happy?

00:01:52.213 --> 00:01:56.363
No, with all the money in
the world I'd never be happy.

00:01:56.363 --> 00:02:00.526
Right cause money is something
that cannot heal the soul.

00:02:00.526 --> 00:02:02.134
You know so many people
put me down and say

00:02:02.134 --> 00:02:03.723
Nick you look too weird
and no one's really friend

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.438
and you can't do this
and you can't do that.

00:02:06.438 --> 00:02:07.703
And I couldn't change anything.

00:02:07.703 --> 00:02:09.284
It's not like just fixing my hair one day

00:02:09.284 --> 00:02:10.961
and everything's fine.

00:02:10.961 --> 00:02:13.363
It's not like you know just whatever,

00:02:13.363 --> 00:02:16.176
I couldn't change my circumstance.

00:02:16.176 --> 00:02:18.084
I couldn't just one day wake up and say

00:02:18.084 --> 00:02:21.099
hey give me arms and legs,
I need arms and legs.

00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:22.650
You know what I mean like ...

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:25.171
I went to a body builder you know and said

00:02:25.171 --> 00:02:27.469
can you make me some arms and
legs, it's no joking. (laughs)

00:02:27.469 --> 00:02:28.711
Body builder you get it?

00:02:28.711 --> 00:02:29.647
(laughter)

00:02:29.647 --> 00:02:32.783
Right, so here's the thing,
you know I go up to people

00:02:32.783 --> 00:02:34.666
can you give me a hand, you
know just joking. (laughs)

00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:39.062
But it was so hard
because people put me down

00:02:39.062 --> 00:02:41.583
and I started believing
that I was not good enough.

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.994
I started believing that I was a failure.

00:02:43.994 --> 00:02:47.237
That I'd never ever be
somebody who people would like

00:02:47.237 --> 00:02:49.692
or people would accept.

00:02:49.692 --> 00:02:51.549
And it was so hard man,
I thought to myself

00:02:51.549 --> 00:02:54.760
you know I can't go on the
soccer field like everybody else

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.540
and I can't ride my bike
and I can't skateboard

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.362
and all these sort of things.

00:02:58.362 --> 00:03:00.612
And I started getting depressed.

00:03:00.612 --> 00:03:02.462
I thought what kind of
purpose do I have to live

00:03:02.462 --> 00:03:04.954
I mean, are you just here to live to die?

00:03:04.954 --> 00:03:07.478
I mean, is there not a purpose for me?

00:03:07.478 --> 00:03:09.726
Is there not a purpose in life?

00:03:09.726 --> 00:03:12.347
And I had questions and no answers

00:03:12.347 --> 00:03:14.254
and I asked my mom and
dad why did this happen?

00:03:14.254 --> 00:03:18.054
I asked doctors why did this
happen and they don't know.

00:03:18.054 --> 00:03:21.838
There are some things in life
that are out of your control

00:03:21.838 --> 00:03:26.372
that you can't change and
you've got to live with.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:29.060
The choice that we have
though is either to give up

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.477
or keep on going.

00:03:31.494 --> 00:03:33.273
I want to ask you, what
are you going to believe?

00:03:33.273 --> 00:03:35.771
Are you going to believe in yourself?

00:03:35.771 --> 00:03:38.967
You going to believe everyone
elses judgment on you?

00:03:38.967 --> 00:03:40.992
Are you going to believe
people when they say

00:03:40.992 --> 00:03:43.016
that you're a failure, when
no one really likes you,

00:03:43.016 --> 00:03:45.447
no one really cares about you?

00:03:45.447 --> 00:03:47.590
It's not really to say that
hey you need someone to come up

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:49.762
and say hey really, I like
you, I care about you.

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:50.948
You know it's not that but

00:03:50.948 --> 00:03:54.195
it's the fact that people put you down.

00:03:54.195 --> 00:03:56.947
People don't even look you in the eye.

00:03:56.947 --> 00:03:58.596
People ask you how you
are and you say fine

00:03:58.596 --> 00:04:01.176
but you're not find and
they'll never know that.

00:04:01.176 --> 00:04:02.183
Life is life.

00:04:02.183 --> 00:04:06.183
Life is an interesting
journey of ups and downs.

00:04:07.184 --> 00:04:10.934
But how that journey
ends is up to you today.

00:04:12.059 --> 00:04:14.957
You see when you fall down
and you feel like giving up,

00:04:14.957 --> 00:04:18.207
When times get tough, it's not the end.

00:04:19.276 --> 00:04:22.501
The question is, are you
going to finish strong.

00:04:22.501 --> 00:04:24.122
The definition of a disability is

00:04:24.122 --> 00:04:25.732
something that will hinder you

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:28.765
from being able to do something.

00:04:28.765 --> 00:04:30.774
I think though the greatest disability

00:04:30.774 --> 00:04:33.150
is not having no arms and no legs.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:35.915
The greatest disability is your mind,

00:04:35.915 --> 00:04:37.847
the choices that you make.

00:04:37.847 --> 00:04:41.167
The question is are you going
to make the right choices?

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:43.819
Are you going to make the
choice to have your life

00:04:43.819 --> 00:04:45.476
in it's right perspective?

00:04:45.476 --> 00:04:49.643
Are you going to make the choice
to get up instead of give up?

00:04:50.715 --> 00:04:53.586
Are you going to make
the choice to dream big?

00:04:53.586 --> 00:04:56.371
There is no greater disability
that we have in our life

00:04:56.371 --> 00:04:59.621
then to make the decision to give up.

00:04:59.621 --> 00:05:02.652
Because once you give up,
then there is no hope.

00:05:02.652 --> 00:05:06.152
But until you give up, there is that hope.

00:05:07.026 --> 00:05:08.555
Do you think I'm going to love my son even

00:05:08.555 --> 00:05:11.825
though if he one day wanted to be a CEO

00:05:11.825 --> 00:05:15.327
and becomes a janitor at a college.

00:05:15.327 --> 00:05:17.744
Yeah, you want to know why?

00:05:18.615 --> 00:05:22.032
Cause a janitor changed my life.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.595
He was the first guy that said "Hey Nick,

00:05:26.595 --> 00:05:28.452
you're going to be a speaker."

00:05:28.452 --> 00:05:31.296
And I said "Mr. Arnold,
you're a crazy old man."

00:05:31.296 --> 00:05:33.516
(laughter)

00:05:33.516 --> 00:05:35.291
I said "What am I going to speak about."

00:05:35.291 --> 00:05:36.652
He said "You're going
to share your story."

00:05:36.652 --> 00:05:37.737
I said "I don't have a story."

00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:38.586
He said "Yes you do."

00:05:38.586 --> 00:05:40.267
I said "No I don't."

00:05:40.267 --> 00:05:43.075
He said "Nick you know what,
you're here in high school.

00:05:43.075 --> 00:05:45.390
You got to go speak at
that spiritual group."

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:46.877
I'm like no way am I doing that.

00:05:46.877 --> 00:05:49.035
No way, I'm not speaking
to those ten people.

00:05:49.035 --> 00:05:51.638
I'm not going to go to the
Christian nerd section.

00:05:51.638 --> 00:05:53.476
(laughter)

00:05:53.476 --> 00:05:55.844
And for three months he
would chase after me and say

00:05:55.844 --> 00:05:57.469
Nick go speak, go speak, go speak.

00:05:57.469 --> 00:05:59.066
And I said no, no, no, no, no.

00:05:59.066 --> 00:06:01.101
And finally he twisted my arm I said yes.

00:06:01.101 --> 00:06:03.485
(laughter)

00:06:03.485 --> 00:06:05.255
And I went there and I
spoke for a couple minutes

00:06:05.255 --> 00:06:07.702
and I saw a girl crying and
I'm like "Are you okay?"

00:06:07.702 --> 00:06:08.535
She said "Uh huh."

00:06:08.535 --> 00:06:09.743
(laughter)

00:06:09.743 --> 00:06:10.688
I said "What's wrong?"

00:06:10.688 --> 00:06:11.615
She says "Nothing."

00:06:11.615 --> 00:06:12.548
(laughter)

00:06:12.548 --> 00:06:13.441
I said "Why you crying?"

00:06:13.441 --> 00:06:15.962
She said "I was just touched."

00:06:15.962 --> 00:06:17.292
And I'm thinking, who touched her?

00:06:17.292 --> 00:06:18.837
(laughter)

00:06:18.837 --> 00:06:20.015
I tell you life is interesting.

00:06:20.015 --> 00:06:21.432
Life's a journey.

00:06:23.379 --> 00:06:25.271
See this phone here.

00:06:25.271 --> 00:06:27.874
Let's say that I want to
go to the phone right?

00:06:27.874 --> 00:06:29.755
And I start from over here.

00:06:29.755 --> 00:06:31.643
Now to get to the phone,

00:06:31.643 --> 00:06:33.014
it's not like I'm going
to start meditating

00:06:33.014 --> 00:06:37.563
and going hum right and
float across the air right?

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:39.721
That's not going to work.

00:06:39.721 --> 00:06:42.120
It's not like I'm going
to go hum mm and woo,

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.386
you know it's not going to work.

00:06:43.386 --> 00:06:46.415
So I have to take one step at
a time, one step at a time,

00:06:46.415 --> 00:06:48.498
one step at a time.

00:06:48.498 --> 00:06:49.947
You can only take one step at a time.

00:06:49.947 --> 00:06:51.159
I don't care how big your step is,

00:06:51.159 --> 00:06:52.266
it's only one step at a time.

00:06:52.266 --> 00:06:55.679
You can't do two steps
in one, you understand?

00:06:55.679 --> 00:06:57.474
So it's like one step at a time

00:06:57.474 --> 00:07:00.236
and you take steps in this direction,

00:07:00.236 --> 00:07:02.380
you take steps in that direction.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:06.483
Sort of get lost along the way
and sometimes you fall down.

00:07:06.483 --> 00:07:09.284
To illustrate my point, I'm
going to jump off the table

00:07:09.284 --> 00:07:12.903
do a back twist and land on the floor.

00:07:12.903 --> 00:07:15.328
Okay, is that cool, are you ready?

00:07:15.328 --> 00:07:16.161
- [girl in Audience]
There's a clock there.

00:07:16.161 --> 00:07:16.994
- There's a clock there?

00:07:16.994 --> 00:07:19.100
Okay can you move the
clock for a second please?

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.075
Beautiful, beautiful all right.

00:07:21.075 --> 00:07:24.650
You ready, so are, are you guys ready?

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:25.584
Just let me know when you're ready.

00:07:25.584 --> 00:07:26.492
(crowd agreement)
Are you ready?

00:07:26.492 --> 00:07:28.825
Okay ready 1, 2 ...

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.482
I'm joking man are you serious?

00:07:32.482 --> 00:07:33.436
Just put the clock back there.

00:07:33.436 --> 00:07:34.539
If I do that, I'll break my arm

00:07:34.539 --> 00:07:35.551
or something you know what I mean?

00:07:35.551 --> 00:07:36.967
(laughter)

00:07:36.967 --> 00:07:38.423
But honestly along the way you might

00:07:38.423 --> 00:07:43.258
fall down like this
ready? (whistles) (boom)

00:07:43.258 --> 00:07:45.635
(laughter)

00:07:45.635 --> 00:07:48.145
(laughs) Hello.

00:07:48.145 --> 00:07:50.450
(laughter)

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:51.591
So what do you do when you fall down?

00:07:51.591 --> 00:07:52.619
- [Audience] Get back up.

00:07:52.619 --> 00:07:54.623
- Get back up, everybody
knows to get back up

00:07:54.623 --> 00:07:57.847
because if I start walking,
I'm not going to get anywhere.

00:07:57.847 --> 00:08:00.173
(laughter)

00:08:00.173 --> 00:08:03.115
But I tell you there is sometimes in life

00:08:03.115 --> 00:08:05.664
where you fall down and you feel like

00:08:05.664 --> 00:08:09.247
you don't have the
strength to get back up.

00:08:10.513 --> 00:08:12.546
You sort of put a mask on your face when

00:08:12.546 --> 00:08:15.883
you come to school and
pretend that everything's okay

00:08:15.883 --> 00:08:20.783
when it's not and you go
home and lay in your bed

00:08:20.783 --> 00:08:22.233
when no one's looking at you,

00:08:22.233 --> 00:08:25.056
when you don't have to impress anybody,

00:08:25.056 --> 00:08:26.723
and you're yourself.

00:08:27.596 --> 00:08:30.887
And fear comes in, you
know the fear that you have

00:08:30.887 --> 00:08:33.274
as soon as you walk into
the doors of your house

00:08:33.274 --> 00:08:35.677
maybe there's a broken home.

00:08:35.677 --> 00:08:38.510
Maybe you have doubt in your life.

00:08:39.455 --> 00:08:41.125
Maybe you don't know for
sure what's going to be

00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:44.811
happening in the future and it scares you.

00:08:44.811 --> 00:08:47.792
Maybe you're worried about
what people think of you,

00:08:47.792 --> 00:08:49.959
what people say about you.

00:08:51.328 --> 00:08:52.831
Just that fear paralyzes you and

00:08:52.831 --> 00:08:54.377
I just want to ask you today,

00:08:54.377 --> 00:08:56.579
do you think you have hope?

00:08:56.579 --> 00:08:59.412
Because I tell you, I'm down here,

00:09:00.265 --> 00:09:01.726
face down,

00:09:01.726 --> 00:09:04.631
and I have no arms, no legs.

00:09:04.631 --> 00:09:06.838
It should be impossible
for me to get back up.

00:09:06.838 --> 00:09:09.483
I mean you go home and
tie the legs and arms

00:09:09.483 --> 00:09:12.121
of your brothers and sisters

00:09:12.121 --> 00:09:14.121
and like push them down,

00:09:15.139 --> 00:09:17.018
and see how long it's going
to take them to get back up.

00:09:17.018 --> 00:09:18.056
You know what I mean?

00:09:18.056 --> 00:09:19.538
You know you can tell them
that you'll see them tomorrow,

00:09:19.538 --> 00:09:20.371
you know what I mean?

00:09:20.371 --> 00:09:21.321
(laughter)

00:09:21.321 --> 00:09:24.274
This is the thing, it should be impossible

00:09:24.274 --> 00:09:27.303
for me to get back up, but it's not.

00:09:27.303 --> 00:09:30.586
You see, I will try 100 times to get up

00:09:30.586 --> 00:09:32.836
and if I fail 100 times ...

00:09:33.678 --> 00:09:36.127
If I fail and I give up, do you think

00:09:36.127 --> 00:09:37.990
that I'm ever going to get up?

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:39.642
No.

00:09:39.642 --> 00:09:43.045
But if I fail I try again
and again and again,

00:09:43.045 --> 00:09:45.537
for as long as I try,
there's always that chance

00:09:45.537 --> 00:09:47.596
of getting up, does that make sense?

00:09:47.596 --> 00:09:48.998
(audience affirms)

00:09:48.998 --> 00:09:52.473
And it's not the end
until you've given up.

00:09:52.473 --> 00:09:55.679
And just the fact that you're here

00:09:55.679 --> 00:09:58.452
should persuade you that
you have another chance

00:09:58.452 --> 00:09:59.702
to get back up.

00:10:01.395 --> 00:10:03.770
There's still hope.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.109
I'm not here today to tell you that

00:10:05.109 --> 00:10:06.079
I understand your pain.

00:10:06.079 --> 00:10:07.728
I don't know how it feels to be abused.

00:10:07.728 --> 00:10:11.536
I don't know how it
feels to feel "fat" and

00:10:11.536 --> 00:10:12.622
you got an eating disorder.

00:10:12.622 --> 00:10:15.601
I don't know how it feels
to have a broken home.

00:10:15.601 --> 00:10:17.684
I don't know how it feels

00:10:20.001 --> 00:10:22.907
but I know how it feels
to have a broken heart.

00:10:22.907 --> 00:10:26.269
And I know how it feels to be alone.

00:10:26.269 --> 00:10:27.587
And I want you to know that I found

00:10:27.587 --> 00:10:29.601
my strength in Jesus Christ
and you're going to find

00:10:29.601 --> 00:10:33.074
your strength in whatever you find it in.

00:10:33.074 --> 00:10:37.251
But I just want you to
know that it's not the end.

00:10:37.251 --> 00:10:40.168
It matters how you're going to finish.

00:10:41.167 --> 00:10:43.500
Are you going to finish strong?

00:10:47.305 --> 00:10:51.472
And you will find that strength
to get back up like this.

00:11:06.134 --> 00:11:07.982
(audience claps)

00:11:07.982 --> 00:11:10.750
My passion is to encourage people,

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:14.321
To inspire people to be
all that they can be.

00:11:14.321 --> 00:11:16.512
I found my purpose.

00:11:16.512 --> 00:11:20.568
I found my strength and
I want you to find yours.

00:11:20.568 --> 00:11:22.707
Don't be afraid of failing.

00:11:22.707 --> 00:11:25.256
Every time you fall down,
every time you fail,

00:11:25.256 --> 00:11:27.088
You learn something new.

00:11:27.088 --> 00:11:28.961
You're ready for the next one.

00:11:28.961 --> 00:11:31.129
You've learned how not to do something.

00:11:31.129 --> 00:11:33.555
Well then learn from it and move on.

00:11:33.555 --> 00:11:36.043
Leave what's behind and press forward.

00:11:36.043 --> 00:11:39.668
You can only win if you don't give up.

00:11:39.668 --> 00:11:43.749
Go for it, don't let
anything hold you back.

00:11:43.749 --> 00:11:46.559
If nothing's holding me back,
what's holding you back?

00:11:46.559 --> 00:11:50.254
I want to make sure that every
single day that you are alive

00:11:50.254 --> 00:11:54.162
that you make it count and
you take the sweeter choices

00:11:54.162 --> 00:11:56.266
of life that God has given you.

00:11:56.266 --> 00:11:58.144
Because I want to ask you right now,

00:11:58.144 --> 00:12:01.009
if this was your last
thirty seconds to breathe,

00:12:01.009 --> 00:12:04.073
how would you be remembered?

00:12:04.073 --> 00:12:07.347
Were you a giver, encourager
or were you a taker?

00:12:07.347 --> 00:12:08.677
Were you a bitter person?

00:12:08.677 --> 00:12:12.662
Did you encourage people to,
in your actions, in your life

00:12:12.662 --> 00:12:15.965
did you help them or
did you discourage them?

00:12:15.965 --> 00:12:18.607
Did you take that time
to say hey how you doing

00:12:18.607 --> 00:12:21.224
and they look to the ground
and say oh you know I'm okay.

00:12:21.224 --> 00:12:23.372
No look at me, how are you doing?

00:12:23.372 --> 00:12:24.932
We are here for one another.

00:12:24.932 --> 00:12:26.438
This is the ministry.

00:12:26.438 --> 00:12:27.852
This is Jesus.

00:12:27.852 --> 00:12:29.352
This is the light.

00:12:30.847 --> 00:12:33.710
And I want to tell you, I
am sure if any one of us

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.937
was at a road and there
was a three year old kid

00:12:36.937 --> 00:12:38.948
in the middle of the street sitting down,

00:12:38.948 --> 00:12:42.912
playing with rocks in the
street and a bus was coming

00:12:42.912 --> 00:12:44.764
and the bus was about to kill him,

00:12:44.764 --> 00:12:47.632
you have plenty of time
to get up off your seat,

00:12:47.632 --> 00:12:48.733
go save that kid.

00:12:48.733 --> 00:12:50.024
Will you save that kid?

00:12:50.024 --> 00:12:51.184
Of course you will.

00:12:51.184 --> 00:12:53.020
You don't know his name,
you're going to save that kid.

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:54.945
You don't know his religion,
you're going to save that kid.

00:12:54.945 --> 00:12:56.439
You don't know his sexual orientation,

00:12:56.439 --> 00:12:57.738
you're going to save that kid.

00:12:57.738 --> 00:12:58.674
Because why?

00:12:58.674 --> 00:13:02.841
We are the light and love and
the bridge to Jesus Christ.

00:13:03.952 --> 00:13:06.972
We need to understand that's it's not just

00:13:06.972 --> 00:13:10.889
doing what we think we
need to achieve or have.

00:13:12.058 --> 00:13:14.289
Some people think that things get easier

00:13:14.289 --> 00:13:16.428
when you get married, uh uh.

00:13:16.428 --> 00:13:17.906
Go talk to some married people.

00:13:17.906 --> 00:13:18.963
(laughter)

00:13:18.963 --> 00:13:20.753
Some single people are
like, oh I'm not happy

00:13:20.753 --> 00:13:24.199
but I know I'm going to be
happy when I get married.

00:13:24.199 --> 00:13:25.623
Dude if you ain't happy single,

00:13:25.623 --> 00:13:27.151
you ain't going to be happy married.

00:13:27.151 --> 00:13:28.125
Can he hear an amen?

00:13:28.125 --> 00:13:28.958
- [Congregation] Amen.

00:13:28.958 --> 00:13:30.196
- Yeah you guys already know it right,

00:13:30.196 --> 00:13:31.158
you could have told me that.

00:13:31.158 --> 00:13:33.313
So what do you want?

00:13:33.313 --> 00:13:34.374
How do you act?

00:13:34.374 --> 00:13:35.374
Who are you?

00:13:37.281 --> 00:13:40.031
Make today count.

00:13:41.285 --> 00:13:42.118
Dream big.

00:13:43.237 --> 00:13:45.509
And never give up.

00:13:45.509 --> 00:13:47.975
The world is a hurting place
and the world needs hope

00:13:47.975 --> 00:13:50.410
and the world needs love.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:53.993
Without hope, we feel
like why are we here?

00:13:55.786 --> 00:13:59.703
Well brokenness, here's mine.

00:14:01.094 --> 00:14:04.677
Today, I still have no arms, no legs,

00:14:05.876 --> 00:14:09.316
but everything's changed, everything.

00:14:09.316 --> 00:14:11.396
For me I was looking
for hope and happiness

00:14:11.396 --> 00:14:13.933
and I couldn't see it for many years.

00:14:13.933 --> 00:14:18.671
In fact if this side of the
table represents my hope,

00:14:18.671 --> 00:14:23.223
truth encourages me to
become more than I can be.

00:14:23.223 --> 00:14:26.067
But then we have lies everyday,

00:14:26.067 --> 00:14:29.820
come into our mind,
people who discourage us.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.872
You know the people that
you have in your life who,

00:14:31.872 --> 00:14:34.912
no matter how good of a day you're having,

00:14:34.912 --> 00:14:37.095
they'll bring you down?

00:14:37.095 --> 00:14:39.392
Or no matter how bad
of a day you're having,

00:14:39.392 --> 00:14:41.884
they'll bring you even lower.

00:14:41.884 --> 00:14:43.925
You know what I'm talking about?

00:14:43.925 --> 00:14:47.605
Think of the three biggest
discouragers in your life.

00:14:47.605 --> 00:14:52.254
They're not your biggest
discouragers, you are.

00:14:52.254 --> 00:14:53.515
You are.

00:14:53.515 --> 00:14:55.073
You're going to take three
seconds for me to tell you

00:14:55.073 --> 00:14:57.341
something discouraging but then,

00:14:57.341 --> 00:15:00.401
you may never forget my words.

00:15:00.401 --> 00:15:04.378
I've met so many 50 year old
women and 40 year old women

00:15:04.378 --> 00:15:07.179
who still remember what
their father's told them,

00:15:07.179 --> 00:15:09.955
that they wish they never heard.

00:15:09.955 --> 00:15:12.175
Words are powerful.

00:15:12.175 --> 00:15:13.708
When you hear those words and

00:15:13.708 --> 00:15:16.802
then your mind starts
growing with these lies,

00:15:16.802 --> 00:15:18.411
Nick you're not good enough.

00:15:18.411 --> 00:15:19.527
Nick just give up.

00:15:19.527 --> 00:15:22.005
Nick you're never going to get a job.

00:15:22.005 --> 00:15:22.838
You won't get married.

00:15:22.838 --> 00:15:24.962
You can't even hold your wife's hand.

00:15:24.962 --> 00:15:26.516
What kind of a father are you going to be

00:15:26.516 --> 00:15:31.261
if you can't even pick up
your kids when they're crying.

00:15:31.261 --> 00:15:32.854
You're alone.

00:15:32.854 --> 00:15:37.021
Sure your parents hug you,
but their hugs can't heal you.

00:15:38.398 --> 00:15:40.125
Just give up.

00:15:40.125 --> 00:15:41.595
Just give up.

00:15:41.595 --> 00:15:42.954
Just give up.

00:15:42.954 --> 00:15:44.303
Just give up.

00:15:44.303 --> 00:15:45.386
Just give up.

00:15:47.008 --> 00:15:50.851
At age eight I thought that
I should commit suicide.

00:15:50.851 --> 00:15:53.434
Why because I didn't have hope.

00:15:54.529 --> 00:15:56.621
I thought I didn't have hope.

00:15:56.621 --> 00:15:59.724
Today you can see that I had hope.

00:15:59.724 --> 00:16:03.092
What's the word, believing
in something you do not see?

00:16:03.092 --> 00:16:03.925
Faith.

00:16:05.094 --> 00:16:07.500
Words can only do so much.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.205
Hugs can do much more than words,

00:16:10.205 --> 00:16:12.309
but when hugs can't do anything,

00:16:12.309 --> 00:16:14.414
that's where faith kicks in.

00:16:14.414 --> 00:16:17.278
For me, words and hugs were not enough

00:16:17.278 --> 00:16:18.815
but I had no faith.

00:16:18.815 --> 00:16:21.083
There are times in life when
you don't see the purpose

00:16:21.083 --> 00:16:23.624
or the good in your situation.

00:16:23.624 --> 00:16:25.610
But just because you can't see it,

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.632
it doesn't mean it's not coming.

00:16:27.632 --> 00:16:30.496
Who goes to the train station,
looks down the railway

00:16:30.496 --> 00:16:33.534
and says augh the train's
not here, I'm leaving.

00:16:33.534 --> 00:16:35.188
You will wait for the train why?

00:16:35.188 --> 00:16:38.938
Because the schedule says
that the train is coming.

00:16:38.938 --> 00:16:41.905
So just because you can't see
the hope in your situation,

00:16:41.905 --> 00:16:44.533
it doesn't mean that it's not there.

00:16:44.533 --> 00:16:47.482
You see, many people think
that I have only one foot,

00:16:47.482 --> 00:16:50.389
just cause you can't see the other one.

00:16:50.389 --> 00:16:52.416
I have gone from a life without limbs

00:16:52.416 --> 00:16:54.890
into a life with out limits.

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.301
What about you?

00:16:56.301 --> 00:16:57.930
- [Nick] The world is a hurting place

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:01.145
and the world needs hope
and world needs love.

00:17:01.145 --> 00:17:03.180
My parents always taught me that

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:06.351
even though we don't know
why I was born this way,

00:17:06.351 --> 00:17:09.116
that we have a choice either to be angry

00:17:09.116 --> 00:17:13.658
for what we don't have or be
thankful for what we do have.

00:17:13.658 --> 00:17:15.092
- I'm here in Slovenia.

00:17:15.092 --> 00:17:19.135
I am so amazed, the trains here are

00:17:19.135 --> 00:17:21.995
so so fast!

00:17:21.995 --> 00:17:22.914
Did you see that one?

00:17:22.914 --> 00:17:24.594
See that's what I'm saying it's so fast.

00:17:24.594 --> 00:17:26.844
(laughter)

00:17:28.078 --> 00:17:29.204
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:17:29.204 --> 00:17:32.846
I made this video because
Max and GTSE asked me too.

00:17:32.846 --> 00:17:33.866
So if there's a famous entrepreneur that

00:17:33.866 --> 00:17:36.421
