00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.776
Leave it in the comments and
I will join in the discussion.

00:17:43.776 --> 00:17:44.866
And finally I wanted to give a

00:17:44.866 --> 00:17:46.880
quick shout out to Karen Setia.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.988
Karen thank you so much for
buying a copy of my book.

00:17:48.988 --> 00:17:50.168
It means a lot to me.

00:17:50.168 --> 00:17:51.720
For those of you watching,
