whatever your one word is.

00:18:01.796 --> 00:18:03.375
And I'll see you soon.

00:18:03.375 --> 00:18:05.875
(loud swoosh)

00:18:09.703 --> 00:18:12.231
- Hi everyone, it's Nick Vujicic.

00:18:12.231 --> 00:18:14.312
You'll never believe
what we're doing today.

00:18:14.312 --> 00:18:18.181
We're here in Dallas Fort
Worth with American Airlines.

00:18:18.181 --> 00:18:20.460
We're doing something
that I always entertained

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.729
in my mind to try doing.

00:18:22.729 --> 00:18:24.764
And that's to dress up
in a pilot's uniform

00:18:24.764 --> 00:18:27.568
and greet the passengers
as they go on the plane,

00:18:27.568 --> 00:18:30.572
courtesy of Captain Glenn Thompson ...

00:18:30.572 --> 00:18:33.088
Captain Glenn Thompson
what are we doing today?

00:18:33.088 --> 00:18:35.422
- Well Nick what we're doing
is, we're fulfilling Nick's

00:18:35.422 --> 00:18:37.828
dream about being an airline captain.

00:18:37.828 --> 00:18:40.728
We're on flight 247
today from Dallas to LAX

00:18:40.728 --> 00:18:43.700
and we're going to have you up
there greeting your passengers.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.832
And you're going to do
inspirational, motivating talk

00:18:45.832 --> 00:18:48.593
to everybody and you are
going to be the man today.

00:18:48.593 --> 00:18:49.426
(laughter)

00:18:49.426 --> 00:18:51.161
I am subordinate to you today sir.

00:18:51.161 --> 00:18:52.356
So you're the captain of this flight.

00:18:52.356 --> 00:18:54.941
I heard Nick had a dream
to be an airline captain.

00:18:54.941 --> 00:18:58.457
I saw him speaking at Lakewood
Church with Joel Olsteen

00:18:58.457 --> 00:18:59.991
and I saw him speaking and

00:18:59.991 --> 00:19:01.214
I actually brought tears to my eyes.

00:19:01.214 --> 00:19:02.794
And I said I can make that happen and

00:19:02.794 --> 00:19:04.616
American Airlines is the company to do it.

00:19:04.616 --> 00:19:06.205
And we're here today to
fill your dream Nick,

00:19:06.205 --> 00:19:07.232
fulfill your dream.

00:19:07.232 --> 00:19:08.524
- I can't believe it's happening.

00:19:08.524 --> 00:19:11.274
- [pilot] That should work right?

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:15.160
- Yeah, I think it's true.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:15.993
Welcome aboard.

00:19:15.993 --> 00:19:18.558
I'm your captain today,
where you chit chat with.

00:19:18.558 --> 00:19:19.655
I'm trying out some new technology.

00:19:19.655 --> 00:19:23.294
Have a great day flight,
and I'll talk to you soon.

00:19:23.294 --> 00:19:24.127
(laughter)

00:19:24.127 --> 00:19:24.970
- [pilot] All right captain.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:25.899
(laughter)

00:19:25.899 --> 00:19:26.745
Thank you captain Nick.

00:19:26.745 --> 00:19:28.290
- Bet you'll be flying with brain today.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.331
- [passenger] Oh really huh.

00:19:29.331 --> 00:19:30.599
- I've got some new
technology we're trying out.

00:19:30.599 --> 00:19:32.198
- [passenger] How fun.

00:19:32.198 --> 00:19:35.219
- Yeah, welcome aboard.

00:19:35.219 --> 00:19:36.324
- Oh yeah you do that.

00:19:36.324 --> 00:19:37.964
- [passenger] I am from
the same place as you.

00:19:37.964 --> 00:19:38.987
- Oh where you from?

00:19:38.987 --> 00:19:39.820
- [passenger] Near Zurich.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.203
- Near Zurich, well man I'm Aussie.

00:19:41.203 --> 00:19:42.036
- [passenger] You are then?

00:19:42.036 --> 00:19:44.156
- Yeah, what's more freak
about me flying the plane?

00:19:44.156 --> 00:19:45.329
The fact that I'm Aussie or

00:19:45.329 --> 00:19:46.470
the fact that I have no arms or legs?

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:47.407
- [passenger] You're an Aussie.

00:19:47.407 --> 00:19:49.505
(laughter)

00:19:49.505 --> 00:19:50.338
- I love it.

00:19:50.338 --> 00:19:51.171
I love it.

00:19:52.053 --> 00:19:53.521
You're awesome, here we are.

00:19:53.521 --> 00:19:54.805
- [passenger] Thanks man.

00:19:54.805 --> 00:19:55.979
- Bye man. (mumbles)

00:19:55.979 --> 00:19:56.812
- Take care man.

00:19:56.812 --> 00:19:57.806
- [passenger] Hey enjoy your flight.

00:19:57.806 --> 00:19:59.139
- Thanks cheers.

00:20:10.402 --> 00:20:11.633
- Hi how are you?

00:20:11.633 --> 00:20:12.758
- [passenger] How are you?

00:20:12.758 --> 00:20:13.591
- Good.

00:20:13.591 --> 00:20:16.520
- [passenger] A flight that
you haven't been on before.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.272
- I'm actually going to be fly it then.

00:20:18.272 --> 00:20:19.105
- [passenger] Cool.

00:20:19.105 --> 00:20:20.700
- I'm the captain.

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:21.533
Enjoy.

00:20:21.533 --> 00:20:23.783
(laughter)

00:20:58.659 --> 00:20:59.492
- Doing really well.

00:20:59.492 --> 00:21:01.704
Notice my palms are sweaty a little bit.

00:21:01.704 --> 00:21:03.518
I'll be flying the plane today.

00:21:03.518 --> 00:21:05.768
(laughter)

00:21:12.208 --> 00:21:13.809
- We're trying out some new technology.

00:21:13.809 --> 00:21:17.068
Today I'll be flying
the plane, so uh yeah.

00:21:17.068 --> 00:21:17.901
- [passenger] That'd be fun.

00:21:17.901 --> 00:21:18.734
- [passenger] I'm excited.

00:21:18.734 --> 00:21:20.324
- Are you good.

00:21:20.324 --> 00:21:21.184
- [passenger] I'm kind of wired.

00:21:21.184 --> 00:21:22.171
- Me too.

00:21:22.171 --> 00:21:24.197
I'm a little nervous,
my knees are shaking.

00:21:24.197 --> 00:21:26.972
(laughter)

00:21:26.972 --> 00:21:29.108
