00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.854
I was like brain waves, I have no idea.

00:21:55.854 --> 00:21:58.977
So cool, the kids were like what?

00:21:58.977 --> 00:22:00.976
Some people are just
like cool, it was cool.

00:22:00.976 --> 00:22:03.057
When you were talking
about the new technology,

00:22:03.057 --> 00:22:05.186
