really safe to fly an airplane

00:22:08.827 --> 00:22:10.590
because he doesn't know
what he's talking about.

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:11.423
They were like set up.
- Did they say that?

00:22:11.423 --> 00:22:12.256
Did they say that?

00:22:12.256 --> 00:22:15.157
- They're are like are you sure its ...

00:22:15.157 --> 00:22:17.536
You know that oh my God this guys
going to take me into the air

00:22:17.536 --> 00:22:19.822
and he's telling me this
funky stuff this ...

00:22:19.822 --> 00:22:20.655
It was funny.

00:22:20.655 --> 00:22:21.715
I love it.
- It was great.

00:22:21.715 --> 00:22:23.301
Go get yours, thank you.

00:22:23.301 --> 00:22:24.134
All right good time.

00:22:24.134 --> 00:22:26.301
Lets greet the passengers.

00:22:27.748 --> 00:22:28.885
How was your boarding?

00:22:28.885 --> 00:22:33.018
It was a mutual on board
as your captain wizard

00:22:33.018 --> 00:22:37.018
and that is the new
technology that we have.

00:22:38.229 --> 00:22:40.971
