00:23:00.576 --> 00:23:01.880
- Yeah.

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:03.551
- Tell me, what did you like,
what did you want to do?

00:23:03.551 --> 00:23:04.685
Like oh my gosh.

00:23:04.685 --> 00:23:06.131
- Yeah I was really scared.

00:23:06.131 --> 00:23:07.050
- Ha ha.

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.366
- Not of you the pilot
but of the technology--

00:23:09.366 --> 00:23:10.199
- [Nick] Oh the technology.
- [passenger] Yeah.

00:23:10.199 --> 00:23:11.324
- [Nick] Yeah that's cool.

00:23:11.324 --> 00:23:13.443
- You think that American would
pull it off that they get--

00:23:13.443 --> 00:23:17.256
- There's no such technology
that brain waves (mumbles)

00:23:17.256 --> 00:23:20.256
- [Nick] (mumbling)

00:23:22.602 --> 00:23:24.951
- Definitely don't force him.

00:23:24.951 --> 00:23:25.784
- How you all doing, how ya doing?

00:23:25.784 --> 00:23:26.754
- Can't complain.

00:23:26.754 --> 00:23:29.909
- Were you scared when
I came up, you weren't?

00:23:29.909 --> 00:23:30.944
- No.

00:23:30.944 --> 00:23:31.877
- Were you a little bit?

00:23:31.877 --> 00:23:32.710
- No.

00:23:32.710 --> 00:23:33.756
- [Nick] Except your face (mumble)

00:23:33.756 --> 00:23:36.006
(laughter)

00:23:40.561 --> 00:23:42.252
- We're training.

00:23:42.252 --> 00:23:43.303
(laughter)

00:23:43.303 --> 00:23:44.562
- I thought it was new technology.

00:23:44.562 --> 00:23:47.559
- We have new technology,
are you guys ready for that?

